        "ScenePath": "assembly:/_PRO/Scenes/Missions/CoastalTown/_scene_octopus.entity",
        "TileImage": "$($repository a4a2e646-b45e-427a-9cb6-0a297f5293a3).Image",
        "Description": "`The Final Prescription`\r\rBeneath Sapienza’s lies a clandestine laboratory operated by the Moirai Division, the organization’s most secure medical research hub. Hidden behind layers of secrecy, its scientists are developing a highly contagious engineered virus capable of devastating entire populations within days. Intelligence suggests the project is nearing completion.\r\rEliminate the head of the Moirai Division along with her senior assistants and ensure the virus never leaves the laboratory alive.",
